Neovarch core (core/)
---------------------
The agent "brain" in core/ (the `neovarch` CLI, the agent loop, tools, sessions,
memory, skills and the `neovarch serve` gateway) is original code written for
Neovarch Agent. It contains no code from Hermes Agent.

Its design and its wire protocol are inspired by Hermes Agent by Nous Research
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
Nous Research). The gateway re-implements, from the public behaviour of that
project, the JSON-RPC-over-WebSocket and REST shapes that the Neovarch desktop
(derived from Hermes Desktop) and the Neovarch phone remote speak, including the
`HERMES_BACKEND_READY` readiness line and the `X-Hermes-Session-Token` header
name, so that the derived desktop works unchanged. We thank Nous Research for
publishing Hermes Agent openly.

