PPT Master (PowerPoint decks)
-----------------------------
The PowerPoint feature (core/neovarch/pptmaster.py, tools ppt_setup/ppt_export)
uses PPT Master by Hugo He (https://github.com/hugohe3/ppt-master, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Hugo He). Its code is not bundled in this repository:
on first use the official skill-only release is downloaded on the user's PC,
checked against a pinned SHA-256 and kept unchanged, with its own LICENSE and
attribution files, in ~/.neovarch/skills/ppt-master. Its optional PDF input
depends on PyMuPDF, which is AGPL-3.0 (Artifex); Neovarch installs PyMuPDF only
when the user asks for PDF sources and never redistributes it. See docs/ppt.md.

